{
  "Npcs.GoblinShaman.Desc": "The goblin before you stands approximately three feet and a half. Her ears appear to be pierced more times than the amount of piercings a typical goblin has. Her hair is deep indigo. She's unlike most of the goblins you've seen. She's wielding a staff in her right hand. In addition to the straps covering her body, she's wearing a necklace seemingly carved with what looks like shark teeth. She's also wearing a tattered loincloth, unlike most goblins who would show off their pussies. From the looks of one end of her staff glowing, she's clearly a shaman!"
  "Npcs.GoblinShaman.DescCockSuffix": " She's clearly intent on casting you into submission just so she can forcibly make you impregnate her."
  "Npcs.GoblinShaman.Name": "goblin shaman"
}
